---
import Callout from "../atoms/Callout.astro";
---

<div
  class="mx-auto mt-11 max-w-md p-4 lg:mt-4 lg:grid lg:max-w-360 lg:grid-cols-7 lg:gap-8 lg:px-15 lg:py-6"
>
  <h2
    class="font-display text-primary text-xl font-bold lg:col-span-2 lg:text-4xl"
    style="line-height: 92%"
  >
    What will I learn?
  </h2>

  <ul
    class="mt-4 ml-4 list-outside list-image-[url(/bullit.svg)] space-y-3.5 text-pretty lg:col-span-4 lg:mt-0 lg:ml-5 lg:list-image-[url(/bullit-large.svg)] lg:space-y-6 lg:text-2xl"
  >
    <li>Why biotech needs capital</li>
    <li>Why drug development is risky</li>
    <li>Why new medicines can be expensive</li>
    <li>Why generics matter</li>
    <li>Why access can fail after approval</li>
    <li>How pricing, patents, payers, policy, and patients fit together</li>
  </ul>

  <Callout class="mt-9 lg:col-span-5 lg:col-start-2 lg:mt-12"
    >Every part covered — R&D, Venture Investments, Clinical Trials, Health
    Economics, Pricing and Policy</Callout
  >
</div>

<style>
  li {
    line-height: 135%;
  }
</style>
